With that kit you could just dive for the Castle instead and save the
remaining lamp for a light source.  Do bless it first, though, just in
case you decide you want the wish after all.  And ID that stuff since
you have the chance, just so you know what you've got.

If you don't have teleport control yet, try to find it: it makes the
Orb much more useful, and will let you come back for saccing later
without having to walk all the way.

