If you're going to wish for an artifact weapon, you might as well go
for Grayswandir rather than Frosty.  As for Magicbane, it's no better
than an ordinary athame (which you can wish for later if necessary) if
you're not going to wield it, which I assume you probably won't.
Besides, you might get it by saccing anyway.

The Eye and the Staff are both nice.  Do note that you'll need to
wield the Staff for it to do you much good.  Of the choices you gave,
I *might* go for the Eye: combined with the Orb, it makes the dungeon
feel really small, and as you say the mana regen is really nice too.
With the Orb and decent AC, HP regen isn't as critical, especially if
you use ranged attacks: HP regen isn't much use if you never end up
losing more than a few HP in the first place.

